<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS1" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.1 </span>The Cognitive Restructuring Hypothesis Is Not Supported</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Constraint as Regularizer</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3 </span>Why the Elaborated Prompt Works</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Practical Implications</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span>Model-Family Heterogeneity and RLHF Interaction</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Relationship to Prior Work</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS7" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.7 </span>What Survives of Umwelt Engineering</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS8" title="In 4 Discussion ‣ Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.8 </span>Discovery Through Disconfirmation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Limitations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Condition Prompts</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Trivial Vocabulary Bans Improve LLM ReasoningMore Than Deep Linguistic Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Deviations from Prospective Analysis Plan</span></a></li>
